            mix preset (e.g. 1:2:4, 1:1.5:3, 1:1:2, 1:3:6) or enter a custom cement:sand:aggregate
            proportion.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Select Cement Bag Size:</strong> Choose 50 kg (standard ISO),
            40 kg, 25 kg, or specify custom packaging.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Configure Dry Volume Factor & Wastage:</strong> Use the standard
            1.54 dry volume factor and adjust the wastage percentage (typically 5%).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Enable Water Estimation if Needed:</strong> Set your target Water-Cement
            ratio (e.g. 0.50) to forecast batching water requirements.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Click Calculate:</strong> Instantly generate material summaries,
            cement bags, sand volume, aggregate tonnage, and mix comparisons.
          </li>
